; layout fixture: a single atom wider than the whole 72-column budget, both bare
; at top level and as the only payload of a list. The bare atom must print
; verbatim; the list cannot fit and must break.
MPN-ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ-0123456789-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
(long-atom MPN-ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ-0123456789-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz)
